Literature sweep completed 2026-05-04.

Source PDB and numbering convention:
- Chain A of pikp1_avrpikf_complex.pdb is an AlphaFold3 monomer prediction
  of native Pikp-1 HMA (UniProt E9KPB5, residues 186–263), renumbered
  1–78 such that contig position 1 = Pikp-1 residue 186 and position 78
  = Pikp-1 residue 263. Translation: pipeline = literature − 185.
- Chain C is AVR-PikF coordinates lifted from PDB 7B1I (Maidment 2021
  JBC; OsHIPP19-HMA / AVR-PikF complex), retaining 7B1I residue
  numbering (which is AVR-Pik precursor 1–113 numbering; resolved range
  31–81). No offset between chain C and AVR-Pik literature numbering.
- AVR-PikF has no dedicated UniProt accession; canonical AVR-Pik is
  UniProt C4B8C0.

Structural-input fallback ladder rung used: rung 5 (AF3 monomer
prediction of native receptor). Justification in §3 of the report.

